From b50db871d78cd2b580e4d327e02dc8fbb3276889 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 06:29:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] perf(spec_decode): shard-local sampled verification and
 resampling

Upstream-Base: 19f2c20ed4d6be5dc5eb7323efccba6ad0eb422f
Rationale: Any stream with temperature > 0 in a decode batch previously forced GPUModelRunner.sample off the shard-local verification path onto a full-vocabulary logits all-gather (129,280 BF16 columns = 258.6 KB/row, or 18.18 MB across TP4 ranks at 16 streams). Add local_stats_shard_kernel, verify_shard_kernel, resample_shard_kernel, resample_shard_pair_kernel, and insert_shard_resampled_kernel so block verification and Gumbel resampling run directly on each rank's vocabulary shard and exchange only 16-byte block statistics and 16-byte per-request resampled pairs across TP ranks (a 970x payload reduction on TP4 and 874x on TP3).
Quality: Exact 0-ULP bit-identical resampled token draws and greedy verification; block verification log-sum-exp reduces over per-shard 8,192-column blocks (within 1 ULP of unsharded reduction).
Tests: pytest tests/v1/worker/gpu/test_greedy_verification.py tests/v1/worker/test_gpu_verified_logprob_token_ids.py tests/v1/worker/test_dead_rows.py
Upstream-Status: spark-ds41f local patch
